cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LIBER, the .liber format, or its library, please cite it as below."
title: "LIBER: The Decision Knowledge Layer for the AI Era"
abstract: >-
  LIBER is the first open decision knowledge layer for the AI ecosystem. It turns
  scattered, decaying knowledge of which option to choose into living, structured,
  machine-readable artifacts — .liber files — that map a decision landscape (options,
  trade-offs, and the contexts that shift which option fits) for both humans and AI agents
  at the moment of decision. This record covers the .liber format specification (FORMAT)
  and the library of decision-knowledge files (LIBRARY).
type: software
